{"id":40,"titleZh":"向维也纳举杯（3/4 拍）","titleEn":"A Toast to Vienna in 3/4 Time","date":"1967-12-25","dateZh":"1967 年 12 月 25 日","concepts":"三四拍、连德勒 vs. 小步舞曲、谐谑曲演化","thesis":"人有两条腿、天生习惯左右迈步的二拍子，正因如此，维也纳音乐里带点腾空延迟感的三四拍摇摆才格外迷人。","plain":"1967 年正逢纽约爱乐与维也纳爱乐共同的 125 岁周年庆。伯恩斯坦没用点名背书的方式介绍维也纳大师，而是专讲“三四拍（3/4 拍）”的源流：农村的连德勒土风舞和宫廷优雅的小步舞曲在莫扎特手里相遇，随后在贝多芬手里急剧加速演变成狂野的谐谑曲。","scenes":["开场大方承认小施特劳斯的圆舞曲就是当年的流行金曲并奏响《维也纳气质》；紧接把莫扎特《德国舞曲》《朱庇特》小步舞曲与贝多芬《第七交响曲》快速谐谑曲连演对照，展示三拍如何一步步提速。","请来歌唱家伉俪克里斯塔·路德维希与沃尔特·贝里分唱、合唱马勒《少年魔号》的三首民俗小歌，最后奏响理查·施特劳斯《玫瑰骑士》圆舞曲致意。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV17E411b78S","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17E411b78S","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 用四三拍为维也纳干杯","duration":"50:31","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/a-toast-to-vienna","repertoire":[{"composer":"Johann Strauss II","piece":"Wiener Blut, Op. 354","titleZh":"维也纳气质圆舞曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Johann%20Strauss%20II%20Wiener%20Blut%2C%20Op.%20354+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Johann%20Strauss%20II%20Wiener%20Blut%2C%20Op.%20354"},{"composer":"Mozart","piece":"German Dance No. 3, K. 605 (Sleigh Ride)","titleZh":"德国舞曲（雪橇）","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview221/v4/07/b8/0e/07b80e6d-4772-a99b-6261-365687c5b8f3/mzaf_8537821425025771478.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/german-dance-no-3-sleigh-ride/82597463?i=82595654&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Capella Istropolitana & Johannes Wildner","recordingTrack":"German Dance No. 3: \"Sleigh Ride\"","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Mozart%20German%20Dance%20No.%203%2C%20K.%20605+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Mozart%20German%20Dance%20No.%203%2C%20K.%20605"},{"composer":"Mozart","piece":"Sy